Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:03.23,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Cada zona de GTA 6 tiene\Nun lugar real detrás.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:05.73,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Te lo explico en\Ncuarenta segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:07.65,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Vice City es Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:10.85,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Los Cayos de Leonida,\Nlos Cayos de Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:13.16,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Y Grassrivers,\Nlos Everglades.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.28,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Port Gellhorn, según\Nla comunidad, recuerda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:19.00,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}al Panhandle, el norte\Ncostero de Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.89,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Y Ambrosia, a su zona\Nazucarera del interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.52,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Y Mount Kalaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.08,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Florida no tiene\Nmontañas de verdad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:28.64,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Ahí Rockstar se ha\Ntomado licencias,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:31.46,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}como hizo con el monte\NChiliad en GTA 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.83,0:00:34.31,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}El vídeo completo del\Nmapa está en el canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:35.98,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Cuál vas a\Nvisitar primero?
